# This file no longer configures anything.
#
# atmusic runs as a Cloudflare Worker (docs/adr/0004-cloudflare-workers.md).
# Local secrets live in worker/.dev.vars, copied from worker/.dev.vars.example;
# deployed secrets are set with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME> [--env <env>]`.
# Non-secret settings are the `vars` of worker/wrangler.jsonc (another
# operator's shape: config/atmusic.workers.example.jsonc).
#
# See docs/deployment.md.
